{
  "video_id": "CyQUvHt-e3A",
  "title": "Why 'Never Mind' is RUDE to Native Speakers (Sound Natural in English)",
  "updated_at": "2026-11-28 22:02:42",
  "subtitles": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.18,
      "en": "At a café in Seattle,",
      "zh": "在西雅圖的一間咖啡廳，"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 3.18,
      "end": 5.44,
      "en": "a customer bumped someone's arm",
      "zh": "有位客人不小心撞到別人手臂，"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 5.44,
      "end": 7.03,
      "en": "and said,",
      "zh": "然後說了聲『我真的很抱歉！』"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 7.03,
      "end": 7.929,
      "en": "\"I'm so sorry!",
      "zh": "結果那位旅人笑著回說："
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 8.9,
      "end": 11.96,
      "en": "The traveler smiled and replied,",
      "zh": "『沒關係。』"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 11.96,
      "end": 12.5,
      "en": "\"Never mind.",
      "zh": "結果那位客人聽了卻\n一臉受傷地走掉了！"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 13.81,
      "end": 15.21,
      "en": "The customer looked hurt",
      "zh": "天啊！"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 15.21,
      "end": 16.519,
      "en": "and walked away!",
      "zh": "課本上都教說，"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 17.519,
      "end": 18.75,
      "en": "Oh no!",
      "zh": "那是『沒關係』的意思耶！"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 18.75,
      "end": 22.519,
      "en": "Textbooks teach \"Never mind\"\nmeans \"It's okay.",
      "zh": "但對母語人士來說，"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 23.359,
      "end": 25.269,
      "en": "But to native speakers,",
      "zh": "聽起來卻像你在拒絕他們的道歉！"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 25.269,
      "end": 27.789,
      "en": "it sounds like you are\nrejecting their apology!",
      "zh": "等等，"
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 28.969,
      "end": 29.589,
      "en": "Wait,",
      "zh": "真的假的？"
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 29.589,
      "end": 30.87,
      "en": "really?",
      "zh": "人家明明就只是想表達善意啊！"
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 30.87,
      "end": 32.689,
      "en": "They just wanted to be nice!",
      "zh": "那句英文，"
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 33.429,
      "end": 37.159,
      "en": "What does \"Never mind\"\nactually sound like?",
      "zh": "實際聽起來會是什麼感覺啊？"
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "start": 37.159,
      "end": 39.78,
      "en": "It sounds frustrated,",
      "zh": "聽起來很煩躁，"
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "start": 39.78,
      "end": 41.31,
      "en": "like \"Forget it,",
      "zh": "像是『算了啦，"
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "start": 41.31,
      "end": 42.939,
      "en": "I don't want to talk about it.",
      "zh": "我不想再談這件事了。』"
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "start": 43.619,
      "end": 46.539,
      "en": "Save \"Never mind\" for\nwhen you change your mind!",
      "zh": "所以，"
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "start": 47.359,
      "end": 48.89,
      "en": "Good to know!",
      "zh": "那句英文留到你改變\n主意的時候再用吧！"
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "start": 48.89,
      "end": 53.289,
      "en": "So how should we reply to\nan apology with friends?",
      "zh": "學到了！"
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "start": 54.369,
      "end": 55.56,
      "en": "With friends,",
      "zh": "那跟朋友之間，"
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "start": 55.56,
      "end": 56.46,
      "en": "say,",
      "zh": "該怎麼回應道歉比較好啊？"
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "start": 56.46,
      "end": 56.859,
      "en": "\"No worries!",
      "zh": "跟朋友之間，"
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "start": 57.49,
      "end": 58.859,
      "en": "It sounds super warm",
      "zh": "你可以說『別擔心！』"
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "start": 58.859,
      "end": 59.7,
      "en": "and relaxed.",
      "zh": "聽起來超溫暖又輕鬆的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "start": 60.74,
      "end": 63.09,
      "en": "What about strangers in daily life?",
      "zh": "那在日常生活中遇到陌生人呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "start": 63.99,
      "end": 65.849,
      "en": "Smile and say,",
      "zh": "笑著說『沒關係！』"
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "start": 65.849,
      "end": 66.26,
      "en": "\"It's okay!\"",
      "zh": "或是『別放在心上。』"
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "start": 66.26,
      "end": 68.56,
      "en": "or \"Don't worry about it.",
      "zh": "就可以了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "start": 69.29,
      "end": 72.079,
      "en": "And what if a coworker\napologizes at work?",
      "zh": "那在職場上，"
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "start": 73.2,
      "end": 74.01,
      "en": "At work,",
      "zh": "如果同事跟你道歉呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "start": 74.01,
      "end": 75.04,
      "en": "say,",
      "zh": "在職場上，"
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "start": 75.04,
      "end": 75.939,
      "en": "\"No problem at all.",
      "zh": "你可以說『沒什麼問題。』"
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "start": 76.489,
      "end": 78.65,
      "en": "That sounds calm and professional.",
      "zh": "這樣聽起來很沉穩又專業。"
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "start": 79.439,
      "end": 81.299,
      "en": "Super clear!",
      "zh": "超級清楚！"
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "start": 81.299,
      "end": 82.969,
      "en": "What is today's golden rule?",
      "zh": "那今天的黃金法則是什麼啊？"
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "start": 84.459,
      "end": 86.4,
      "en": "Golden rule:",
      "zh": "黃金法則："
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "start": 86.4,
      "end": 88.819,
      "en": "Never say \"Never mind\" to an apology.",
      "zh": "回應道歉的時候，"
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "start": 89.689,
      "end": 91.549,
      "en": "Say \"No worries\" or \"It's okay!",
      "zh": "絕對不要說那句英文。"
    }
  ]
}